==English==

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|la|resorbere}}, from {{m|la|re-||again}} + {{m|la|sorbere||to suck in}}.

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{lb|en|transitive}} To [[absorb]] (something) again.
# {{lb|en|intransitive}} To undergo [[resorption]].
# {{lb|en|biology|transitive}} To [[dissolve]] (bone, sinew, suture, etc.) and [[assimilate]] it.

